{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.sinh_zeta4_rotation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.sinh_zeta4_rotation","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.lean#L71-L80","doc":"**`Im 𝔙 ↦ i·Re-channel`.** The companion: the same rotation sends `sinh η` to `i·cosh η`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.cosh_zeta4_rotation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.cosh_zeta4_rotation","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.lean#L58-L69","doc":"**`Re 𝔙 ↦ i·Im-channel`.** The `ζ₄ = i` rotation `η ↦ η + iπ/2` sends `cosh η` to `i·sinh η`:\nthe bar-even (binding) channel rotates into `i ×` the bar-odd (Q_β) channel — the\n`Re 𝔙 ↔ i·Im 𝔙` coupling of the complex volume `𝔙 = Vol + i·CS`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.barOdd_zeta4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.barOdd_zeta4","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.lean#L51-L54","doc":"At `q = ζ₄ = i` the **bar-odd** generator `h = q − q⁻¹` (Q_β / `Im 𝔙`, sinh-type) becomes\n**pure imaginary** `2i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.barEven_zeta4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.barEven_zeta4","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.lean#L46-L49","doc":"At `q = ζ₄ = i` the **bar-even** generator `[2]_q = q + q⁻¹` (binding / `Re 𝔙`, cosh-type)\n**vanishes**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.phi4_root_zeta4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.phi4_root_zeta4","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Zeta4ComplexVolumeModerator.lean#L42-L44","doc":"`Φ₄(ζ₄) = 0`: `ζ₄ = i` is the root of the shared cyclotomic residue `Φ₄ = q²+1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}